		(property "Notes" "User-selected QFN variant. 32 GPIOs; complete shared-bus and peripheral allocation before circuit placement. Pin 53 is exposed VSS pad. DECRF must connect to DECA. DECUSB is the USB regulator decoupling node; keep USB VBUS separate from VDD. Single symbol unit with classical hidden duplicate power pins."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "F.SilkS")
